<title>USA: MedPartners names Mark Wagar president/COO.</title>
<headline>MedPartners names Mark Wagar president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedPartners Inc said it had named Mark Wagar president and chief operating officer to replace Larry House, who will remain chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>For the past year, Wagar has been president of the company's western operations. He was COO of Mullikin Medical Enterprises, which merged with MedPartners in 1995, and is a former president of CIGNA Health Care of California, the company said.</p>
</text>
